  "description": "“I’ve come to retrieve the toy I let go.”\n\nFor the sake of her father’s business, Juhui was forced to become 'friends' with Jaewook.\nJaewook lingered around her, subtly controlling everything.\n\n“Try to escape if you can.\nIt won’t change the fact that you’re my toy.”\n\nAnd eventually, he seized her completely.\n\n“I have no intention of letting you go.”\n“Han Jaewook, you’re insane. This is absolutely not love.”\n“I don’t care. My love was twisted from the start anyway.”\n\nJuhui is trapped—\nbecause of a love she cannot understand.\n\n\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12510428)",
